<title>POLAND: NFI units rise in Warsaw continuous trade.</title>
<headline>NFI units rise in Warsaw continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish NFI units rose 2.5 percent to 101.5 zlotys in four-million zloty continuous trade on Thursday. Wednesday turnover was at 2.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>No stocks in the continuous system traded on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
